SUMMARY:Scholastic Book Fair: Benefiting Asheville City Schools Foundation
DESCRIPTION:The Fall Fair is Here!\nWe had so much fun during our Summer fair\, we decided to go for round two! Visit us Tuesday October 13th – Sunday October 18th to shop books and fun trinkets for kids Kindergarten-Eighth Grade. All proceeds from the book fair directly support the Asheville City Schools Foundation. Fair hours will vary Tuesday-Sunday\, and we’ll close out the week with a special event on Sunday October 18th! \nTuesday October 13th: 2-6p\nWednesday\, Thursday & Friday the 14th\, 15th & 16th: 3-9pm\nSaturday 17th: 12-6pm\nSunday 18th: 12-7pm\nSunday October 18th: Join us from 2-4pm to create your very own storybook character with watercolor paints!
URL:https://devilsfootbrew.com/event-detail/scholastic-book-fair-benefiting-asheville-city-schools-foundation/2026-10-17/
CATEGORIES:Fundraiser
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://craftpeak-cooler-images.imgix.net/devils-foot-beverage-company/IG-fall-Book-fair-.jpg?auto=compress%2Cformat&ixlib=php-3.3.1&s=96536a452c0f85c5b7165d24facf5dd6
END:VEVENT
