SUMMARY:Wednesday Jazz: Fall Series
DESCRIPTION:On The Patio\nYour favorite Jazz night in Asheville continues through September & October! With delicious drink specials and fabulous riffs from Danny Iannucci & Friends\, Wednesday nights are booked! Join us from 6-8p to enjoy the rotating jazz trio & 1/2 Off Wine\, $10 Specialty Martinis\, and $4 Select Craft Drafts. \nFree to attend and all ages are welcome. \n*Rain or Extreme temps will bring us indoors.
URL:https://devilsfootbrew.com/event-detail/wednesday-jazz-fall-series/2026-10-21/
