SUMMARY:BPM: Beats Per Murder
DESCRIPTION:A Fundraiser for Trans Lifeline\nCome shake your ass like your life depends on it at BEATS PER MURDER. BPM features a powerhouse lineup of NC DJs\, we’re spinning moody dark techno and club bangers all night culminating in the WORLD PREMIERE of The Scream music video\, by @Buggy and @bulletproofcyberheaven. All proceeds of ticket sales will be donated to @translifeline. Come dance like it’s the end of the world for a good cause. Local AVL vendors will also be in attendance so you can snag some cool shit while you’re at it\, FUCK SHEIN!!! Outfit prompt: SEXY TEXAS CHAINSAW MASSACRE. \n21+. \nThis event is from 8pm-2am.\n Tickets and more info here!
URL:https://devilsfootbrew.com/event-detail/bpm-beats-per-murder/
CATEGORIES:Hosting with Friends
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://craftpeak-cooler-images.imgix.net/devils-foot-beverage-company/FINALREELSIZEIG-REEL-SIZE.png?auto=compress%2Cformat&ixlib=php-3.3.1&s=18f860f4e6dba556fec5a03296b97d2a
END:VEVENT
