SUMMARY:Spooky: What's Shaking? Kid's Music & Dance Party
DESCRIPTION:Calling all little witches\, goblins\, ghouls\, and monsters!\nWhat’s Shaking? returns to The Mule for a special Halloween event! Costumes encouraged alongside a hankering for lots of candy! \nSee you on the dance floor from 3-5pm on Saturday October 31st!
